From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:09:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] tu/autotune: Correct the estimates with measured render
 pass times

TU_AUTOTUNE_FLAGS=adapt, or the tu_autotune_flags drirc option, times every render pass and corrects its estimates
by what was measured for that pass. Passes close to a tie sometimes run in the other mode, so both sides get measured.
